Z||000005||WMEBERT||07-04-2001||08:00 PM||||Any warranty on replacement parts Lifetime or otherwise ONLY applies to the original purchaser.  Once the car is sold the warranty is void.  You "might" be able to B.S. the parts guy and if he's in a good mood he'll still honor it.  I was a DM for AutoZone for 6 years and am now one for Advance Auto Parts so I have a "little" knowledge of the warranties.<BR> ||||reg||6
Z||000006||CoolBlue87GT||07-05-2001||08:56 AM||||Yes Autozone will fix you up !!<P>I had mine replaced 2.5 years after buying, and did not have the recipt.<P>Go for it !!||||reg||6
